# Normalise line endings so the repository stays LF regardless of who commits.
# 统一换行符:仓库里一律存 LF,不管是谁在什么系统上提交。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only tooling that should keep CRLF when checked out.
# 只在 Windows 上用的脚本,检出时保留 CRLF。
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary-ish assets: never touch them.
# 二进制资产:一律不做任何转换。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.eml binary
